s","/farmland-atlas/texas/houston-county"],["ARC or PLC in Houston County","/arc-plc/texas/houston-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Houston County runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 41 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids had May to June at 200% of normal and September to October at 53%. January to February 2026 sat at 53% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 13038 had its driest year in 2011 at 52% of normal.</p>"}
